    "precision": "Representative point inside USTC’s named Gaoxin parent campus at 100 Fuxing Road, Hefei. It locates the campus, not a data-centre building, room, entrance, phase boundary or surveyed parcel.",
    "identity_review": "The September 9 operator report explicitly identifies Gaoxin campus for the September 7 data-centre visit. The university’s official campus list distinguishes Gaoxin at 100 Fuxing Road from its other Hefei campuses and identifies its southern Fuxing Road and western Shilian South Road entrances. OSM relation 14093671 exactly names 中国科学技术大学（高新校区）, lists USTC as operator, and matches those surrounding roads. Its two outer components are labelled Phase 1 and Phase 2; the relation bounding-box midpoint lies inside southern outer way 875338394 and outside the inner exclusion. This geometric choice does not assign the data-centre room to Phase 1. The news-site footer’s 96 Jinzhai Road is the separately listed East campus and is not used as the facility address.",
    "horizontal_uncertainty_metres": null,
    "uncertainty_reason": "The native community map supplies no measured horizontal accuracy. The data-centre building and room are not identified, so displacement from this parent-campus marker is unknown."
